   $q$[{"q": "Do Yarmouth buyers really shop online?", "a": "Yes — they research online and buy local if the store looks trustworthy. A complete Google profile and real inventory photos decide whether they call you or drive to Halifax."}, {"q": "Should we have French content?", "a": "If you serve Clare and the Acadian communities, yes, where you can do it well. Even a few key pages and replies in French show respect for the market."}, {"q": "What matters most for a remote market?", "a": "Service and trust. Make service booking easy, keep your profile accurate, and reply to every review."}, {"q": "Is paid advertising worth it here?", "a": "Small, targeted campaigns can be very cost-effective because there's little competition. Fix your Google profile and reviews first."}]$q$::jsonb,
