  ($q$amherst$q$, $q$Amherst$q$, $q$Nova Scotia$q$, $q$Canada$q$, $q$On the NS–NB border — a small market that loses buyers to Moncton unless it gives them a reason to stay.$q$, $q$Market page$q$, $q$Car dealership marketing in Amherst.$q$,
